{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/d164b9719aefa4f303eb7cbeacb4b385.avif?t=1765597124\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve become the balance director of a brand-new card game company. <br>You thought sitting in the office and working would be enough, but\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angry users dissatisfied with the game keep smashing through the company doors,<br>challenging you to card battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you keep losing, massive repair costs will pile up,<br>and the company will go under.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have only two choices: <br>Carefully balance the game to calm the users\u2026 <br>or use every means available to a director to beat them into submission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/ece17585cab670cfae84671bdc9cce67.avif?t=1765597124\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/ad25eae8044e1c738da553e0b012ed9c.avif?t=1765597124\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your TCG deck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the optimal deck using the card pool you released. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/a501330c7408c0784d1d12b6c0ed88ad.avif?t=1765597124\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire staff through card battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dispatch hired staff to gain various upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/141a88afa9e4edab96e3414f59072198.avif?t=1765597124\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance the card game!</strong><br>If there\u2019s a card you don\u2019t like, ban it immediately!<br>(All complaints resulting from that decision are your responsibility.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive as the director of this card game company?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/02e9a93fa4b8e13dba52f623090e2584.poster.avif?t=1765597124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/02e9a93fa4b8e13dba52f623090e2584.webm?t=1765597124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/02e9a93fa4b8e13dba52f623090e2584.mp4?t=1765597124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.